  "description": {
    "raw": "Using this spell, the caster rapidly decomposes the flesh from a single corpse of size Huge or smaller, leaving behind a perfectly cleaned skeleton. If it is cast on a non-skeletal corporeal undead, the creature takes a –2 penalty on all rolls and to its Armor Class and CMD for 1 minute.",
    "search_text": "\"using this spell, the caster rapidly decomposes the flesh from a single corpse of size huge or smaller, leaving behind a perfectly cleaned skeleton. if it is cast on a non-skeletal corporeal undead, the creature takes a –2 penalty on all rolls and to its armor class and cmd for 1 minute.\"",
